&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ months work experience, preferably within relevant industry but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German speaker preferred, but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong passion for the creator industry and understanding of the competitive landscape in which we operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and have the ability to efficiently maintain report accuracy while meeting deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in or experience utilising/manipulating numbers and data to derive insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational organisational &amp;amp; project management skills, ability to meet deadlines, and attention to detail to routinely produce zero-defect work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to learn quickly and adapt to individual team requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the MAC OS X and Google Drive Platforms&lt;/li&gt;
